<title>POLAND: POLISH APRIL CONSTRUCTION OUTPUT UP YR/YR 35.8 PCT.</title>
<headline>POLISH APRIL CONSTRUCTION OUTPUT UP YR/YR 35.8 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction sales rose</p>
<p>17.7 percent in April after a 22.7 percent rise in March and</p>
<p>were 35.8 percent higher than in April 1996, the Central</p>
<p>Statistical Office (GUS) said.</p>
<p>Construction sales increased 27.8 percent in the</p>
<p>January-April period against the same period of last year.</p>
</text>
